question/math-academy-id "q-214755" :question/problem "Find the solution to the inequality $1<\\frac{x+5}{3}\\le 2.$\n\n{{field-1}}{{field-2}}$\\,x\\le $\n\n{{field-3}}" :question/worked-solution "We isolate $x$ by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual.\n\nFirst, we multiply by $3$ to eliminate the fraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & <\\frac{x+5}{3}\\le 2 \\\\ 3\\cdot 1 & <3\\cdot \\frac{x+5}{3}\\le 3\\cdot 2 \\\\ 3 & <x+5\\le 6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we continue isolating $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}3 & <x+5\\le 6 \\\\ 3-5 & <x+5-5\\le 6-5 \\\\ -2 & <x\\le 1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $-2<x\\le 1.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-214755/field-1" "q-214755/field-2" "q-214755/field-3"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7229f1d0-4ba7-50ff-b5be-5697c886a175"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-214755"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-29055/selection/dd53cf89614419a32608b148556ef8aca4151345802762d2648e16d1975e64c1" :answer/id #uuid "bfe09680-d535-5860-a6cb-731c2ef20ac0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2<x<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29055/selection/95ff835394d20c2fc62dc1849f5d9c97a2a72a36ea20ecdb508bad97f5e7bf78" :answer/id #uuid "000a5992-53fc-5cca-928c-a418770a99af" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4<x<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29055/selection/d6edfb06a110f840dfd9709a380712d45f583e9b7c62cf556b16a8bf8d8db641" :answer/id #uuid "0cc3a63b-baa8-5e5f-b731-fc491d6c923c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4<x<2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29055/selection/6f27755cbecd36cf5ed6b27aef81baa95f913bc664277798c75f0df67ef658ac" :answer/id #uuid "e1bcaa14-e541-561b-a2e1-718107b7fee1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0<x<2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-29055/selection/8abfcb4c97e75fe52e07c1c22a358eada2ac613434f2c174b5a0e52df9fc67