\\frac{9}{3} \\\\ 1 & \\le x<3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $1\\le x<3.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-73871/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7229f1d0-4ba7-50ff-b5be-5697c886a175"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-73871"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection/c34e99fb7605307ddabece47697b04f975464e7c55806570a0f168cf072bc321" :answer/id #uuid "0c661258-e343-5caf-b404-4d88776ab4e2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{5}{3}<x<10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection/c4d426f17eaec549f002ce9c9d3e720d5b443d29ff1744e7a9c9b1b91def3b2b" :answer/id #uuid "0ea8e6fc-1909-5701-bcb1-d05cdb0b8858" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1<x<\\frac{5}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection/602fdedfcac72ce50aa91e1b47f68a96ee386544bbc597f21b1b67badcf270e4" :answer/id #uuid "86339e15-f8c6-5b31-9392-5e3b9c70a4f8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{3}<x<-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection/39ba2deec4f6c062b5f18efb9b7fb3db720662de4e699d402a36f713f5199fcb" :answer/id #uuid "92c876c4-1aa3-57ec-8011-5446a8d45a70" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1<x<\\frac{5}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection/52cf24dc1bcfea0502383088b91b034c5071d2767a51fc69a066887006311061" :answer/id #uuid "1534e659-7d62-588f-82d0-64aedca58ad3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-10<x<\\frac{5}{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "78ca0120-ba14-5160-92e4-065799b4bc58" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-3068/selection/c4d426f17eaec549f002ce9c9d3e720d5b443d29ff1744e7a9c9b1b91def3b2b" :answer-field/choices ["q-3068/selection/c34e99fb7605307ddabece47697b04f975464e7c55806570a0f168cf072bc321" "q-3068/selection/c4d426f17eaec549f002ce9c9d3e720d5b443d29ff1744e7a9c9b1b91def3b2b" "q-3068/selection/602fdedfcac72ce50aa91e1b47f68a96ee386544bbc597f21b1b67badcf270e4" "q-3068/selection/39ba2deec4f6c062b5f18efb9b7fb3db720662de4e699d402a36f713f5199fcb" "q-3068/selection/52cf24dc1bcfea0502383088b91b034c5071d2767a51fc69a066887006311061"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-3068" :question/id #uuid "24c30c42-4d03-5a02-a7b6-b011ed8ec16b" :question/math-academy-id "q-3068" :question/problem "Solve the inequality $-1<\\frac{6x-8}{2}<1.$" :question/worked-solution "We isolate $x$ by applying the addition and multiplication principles, as usual.\n\nFirst, we multiply by $2$ to eliminate the fraction:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-1 & <\\frac{6x-8}{2}<1 \\\\ -1\\cdot 2 & <\\frac{6x-8}{2}\\cdot 2<1\\cdot 2 \\\\ -2 & <6x-8<2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThen, we continue isolating $x:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-2 & <6x-8<2 \\\\ -2+8 & <6x-8+8<2+8 \\\\ 6 & <6x<10 \\\\ \\frac{6}{6} & <\\frac{6x}{6}<\\frac{10}{6} \\\\ 1 & <x<\\frac{5}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the solution is $1<x<\\frac{5}{3}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["q-3068/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "7229f1d0-4ba7-50ff-b5be-5697c886a175"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-3068"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-214698/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "a13015b8-0307-51b9-a439-4cbd957dc243" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-214698/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0ec2be3b-1ce5-5815-a35b-8bb48678c025" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-214698/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-214698/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db